{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_019_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:910a1160031658604366be9a15561d129dbfede0071f8d29864779eee1c9e28f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_019_22:5_02_019_22_a:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9910cdf1ceedd6897eea8b2f3a2fdfe27de65b77139263fdc4dcef2e62d3741c",
      "text": "辛苦了。●●●●プロデューサー。\n我一直在等您。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_019_22:5_02_019_22_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92b97784ed21aa938f46f4314729c92623b3cf7448e059bd26c261fdff337973",
      "text": "正逢白色情人节，\n我准备了上个月的回礼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_019_22:5_02_019_22_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8eae6e07fc550444ee5081590a52bcb1fb866929ae4327ea58917d35d41e3992",
      "text": "虽然在究竟该以何种形式回礼上犹豫了一阵……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_019_22:5_02_019_22_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c64a796cc0223beeed0e2e0c524a1a51e53e066ce23605f1df44cbdcc7a0a9bb",
      "text": "但我觉得将心意传达出来才是最重要的，\n便以我自己的方式进行了挑选。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_019_22:5_02_019_22_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8be04f8e981d240969cc23a754371016bd21ec5872f95321cbfd24f7930ca933",
      "text": "其中饱含着我的感激之情，\n请您收下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_019_22:5_02_019_22_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfb850bfe5c9fc779148b37a7845bcda21891fc02417fe1b1e762a45e178f4ef",
      "text": "巧克力我全都美味地享用完了。\n非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_019_22:5_02_019_22_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ed2335d036a817df54852b66f2dcc813d59b48b1608915984602a991c9d893a",
      "text": "辛苦了，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_019_22:5_02_019_22_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2aeaff2bde16d3e00d486002af7b94d50a5efaa2e0b6de91b71f77c3d8c29ab",
      "text": "听说制作人会回到事务所，\n我便在此等候了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_019_22:5_02_019_22_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:895494413c18070696d8913e3a101d410b4780b408ef66241f4e874f261ba4a8",
      "text": "未能事先联络真是抱歉。若是提前告知在此等候，\n我担心会让您匆忙赶路。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_019_22:5_02_019_22_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d272daaf14386fb9cecdb60684f88355d252b2a92b912aa8a76e5abe0743d3d2",
      "text": "这是情人节的回礼。\n请您收下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_019_22:5_02_019_22_b:cmd-000037:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7e8266a78304c6acc523897738228ba5aeafedf9dbc31f8042cd8b7897ef1e8",
      "text": "非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_019_22:5_02_019_22_b:cmd-000038:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bd11c80ab3ae637bc1577f57e3cd6f5c8cfcd84c3bf27995464416bfd3c0fe6",
      "text": "太高兴了！很期待拆开呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_019_22:5_02_019_22_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c66bb34a1c7ca11554110d660d1fb43bde54236129db4c3b82ddb796c909e3d",
      "text": "见您似乎很高兴，我也就放心了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_019_22:5_02_019_22_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:937adeda5d26ba5dbe2e76642cb413edb2e66062d2f3d432d53784663f5fd0ad",
      "text": "在收到情人节巧克力时我也曾说过，\n我真的感到无比欣喜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_019_22:5_02_019_22_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cceb1c15a24a19348512bca32802cf7cbcaf65b70d2935cdcdf687c676e688a2",
      "text": "为了能将那时的心情也通过回礼传达给您，\n我挑选了这一份礼物。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_019_22:5_02_019_22_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee774074feeb08b84f62c4df5ae6ef6ea886ca0b5645d107fcf86a30c343a027",
      "text": "若是能合您的心意就好了。\n那么，打扰了。我先告辞了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
